Package: qt6-base-dev
Version: @DEB_QTBASE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.qt.io/
Depends: qt6-base (= @DEB_QTBASE_V@)
Description: Development files for Qt 6 base
 Headers, CMake package files, pkg-config files and mkspecs needed to build
 software against the Qt 6 base libraries on the Xios desktop. Cross-building
 additional Qt modules also requires a matching host Qt for the native tools
 (moc, rcc, uic); see the qtbase recipe in the build tree.
